      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "In early March, the Falah Bake Sale event raised over 26,000 PKR, drawing significant participation from students and faculty members. This fundraising initiative featured a variety of homemade treats and snacks brought by volunteers."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Following the bake sale, Falah organised a movie night later in the month. Attendees enjoyed a classic film alongside snacks from food stalls operated by student volunteers. The event raised over PKR 11,000 from food and ticket sales for patient welfare. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "In addition to these efforts, Falah hosted a successful blood drive at the University Center in late February, collecting over 100 bags of blood. The high turnout was composed of fellow students, faculty, and staff, as members of the AKU family came out in support of Falah's cause for patient welfare."
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
